        "upstream_review": null,
        "excerpt": "[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-10-02T10:21:53.000019+00:00 by TEAM_LEAD (rp_batch_15): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\nBatch status note — Competing rubric dimensions: factuality versus instruction adherence. Please keep examples in this thread while we check the scope.\n\nContext reply [1790936562.000113] by U007 (QA_TUTOR):\nWas the requested structure mandatory, and were the factual statements correct independently?\n\nContext reply [1790936607.000226] by U001 (TEAM_LEAD):\nPlease paste the exact formatting instruction; QA needs to verify whether it was mandatory before weighing the responses."
      },
